      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{622303ad13e8f032580529a0|full_name}: We have spent a good deal of time trying to resolve this issue fully but unfortunately have not gotten it to a state where we are satisfied, things have been improved to a point where the JP region load times are normal (compared to other regions) with it being slower only sometimes during peak hours for the region.\n\nAdditionally in the last few weeks we have made various changes to ensure things are in the best place possible before the holidays, if all goes well the issue should basically not be noticeable at all. We will be continuing to monitor things over the holidays and at the start of next year return to work on this issue.",
