      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ba749f34dca6b351d658330|full_name}: Sorry for the late response. I have a bit more information at this point and can hopefully shed some light on the issue. The source of the issue is, to my understanding, upstream of us, which makes any full solution very difficult. Currently, we are essentially manually applying first-aid every time an issue occurs, and on a cycle to try to be preventative. However, every now and then the issue reoccurs and we have to manually patch it again. \n\nThat said, do keep letting us know when issues occur, so we can address them, and we are doing our best to get the upstream issue resolved as soon as possible.",
